	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element wpb_animate_when_almost_visible wpb_zoomIn zoomIn vision-box" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p><em>Welcome to the College of Engineering at Dr. APJ Abdul Kalam University, Indore.</em></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>As the Principal, it is my privilege to lead a vibrant academic community dedicated to nurturing innovation, excellence, and integrity in engineering education. With over two decades of experience in higher technical education and academic leadership—spanning national and international institutions—I remain deeply committed to fostering an environment that inspires both intellectual curiosity and practical competence.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Our college is a key pillar of the university, comprising the College of Engineering, School of Engineering, and College of Diploma Engineering. Together, we are shaping future-ready engineers through a dynamic blend of rigorous academics, industry-aligned curriculum, cutting- edge research, and a strong emphasis on values and ethics.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>We believe that education is not merely about acquiring knowledge, but also about cultivating critical thinking, problem-solving abilities, and a mindset of lifelong learning. Through our dedicated faculty, modern infrastructure, and a collaborative ecosystem, we strive to empower our students to become innovative professionals and responsible citizens.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>At Dr. APJ Abdul Kalam University, we draw inspiration from the vision and ideals of our namesake—India’s Missile Man and People&#8217;s President—who believed in the transformative power of education and technology for nation-building. We are committed to carrying this legacy forward by equipping our students with the skills, mindset, and passion to create positive change in the world.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>I welcome you to explore the opportunities our institution offers and become a part of this exciting journey of growth and excellence.</p>

